sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Governed Buyer Chat Architecture
    accDescr: Prompt-led buyer chat runs through the Next.js BFF and Node API, which owns authentication, durable conversation events, agent calls, and payment execution.

    box Client
        participant buyer as Buyer browser
        participant bff as Next.js BFF
    end
    box Backend
        participant api as Node API
        participant agent as Agent service
        participant db as Supabase
        participant payment as Stripe MPP
    end

    buyer->>bff: Send shopping prompt
    bff->>api: POST /v1/chat with session
    api->>api: Verify owner and resolve conversation
    api->>db: Persist user message
    api->>agent: POST /v1/chat with service token
    agent->>agent: Decide whether catalog search is needed
    agent-->>api: Clarification, products, or mandate with activity
    api->>db: Persist assistant message and agent events
    api-->>bff: Committed response with conversation ID
    bff-->>buyer: Render clarification, cards, or mandate

    opt Buyer requests mandate approval
        buyer->>bff: Confirm with passkey
        bff->>api: Approve mandate
        api->>db: Persist passkey approval and mandate activation
        api-->>bff: Approved mandate
        bff-->>buyer: Enable governed execution
    end

    opt Mandate executes
        buyer->>bff: Execute approved mandate
        bff->>api: Submit execution
        api->>payment: Execute MPP payment
        alt Payment succeeds
            payment-->>api: Receipt and listings
            api->>db: Persist payment execution
            api-->>bff: Purchase result
            bff-->>buyer: Show receipt
        else Payment fails
            payment-->>api: Failure
            api->>db: Persist payment failure
            api-->>bff: Payment error
            bff-->>buyer: Show recoverable error
        end
    end

    Note over buyer,db: No browser access to agent token, service-role key, payment credentials, or biometric material.
